# Timing exceptions of the subsystem spw_port of dual_rmap_node, in terms of its ports and instances. Read the file
# scoped to the entity: read_xdc -ref spw_port spw_port.xdc (in a project: set_property SCOPED_TO_REF spw_port
# [get_files spw_port.xdc]). The clocks come from dual_rmap_node.
#
# I/O registers: the output flip-flops of spw0_Spw_DOut, spw0_Spw_SOut belong in the I/O blocks at the pins of the top
